# --- PCB fabrication data: NEVER COMMIT ---
# Raw Gerber/drill/BOM/CAD files are full fabrication data for a real board;
# publishing them would let anyone manufacture it. Only derived SVG/raster
# renders under public/pcb/ may ever ship. See AGENTS.md security invariants.
# Anchored to repo root (leading slash) so it ignores ONLY the top-level Altium
# project, NOT scripts/pcb/ or public/pcb/ (git ignore is case-insensitive on
# Windows, so a bare `PCB/` would swallow every `pcb/` dir).
/PCB/
*.PcbDoc
*.SchDoc
*.PrjPcb
*.PcbLib
*.SchLib
*.Cam
*.DRR
*.EXTREP
*.APR_LIB
*.apr
*.LDP
*.REP
*.cvg
*.GTL
*.GBL
*.GTS
*.GBS
*.GTO
*.GBO
*.GTP
*.GBP
*.G[0-9]
*.GP[0-9]
*.GM
*.GM[0-9]
*.GM[0-9][0-9]
*.TX[0-9]
